### Inventory and its seeded products
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products

### Check availability directly
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/MOUSE/availability?quantity=2

### Happy path: expected CONFIRMED, total 50.00
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"MOUSE","quantity":2,"paymentMethod":"CARD"}

### Simulated payment decline
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"MOUSE","quantity":1,"paymentMethod":"DECLINE"}

### Out of stock: REJECTED, payment is not called
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"KEYBOARD","quantity":1,"paymentMethod":"CARD"}

### Unknown product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"UNKNOWN","quantity":1,"paymentMethod":"CARD"}

### Validation failure: HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"MOUSE","quantity":0,"paymentMethod":"CARD"}

### Saved orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Saved order (replace ID if needed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### Saved payments
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments
